    <item>
      <title>Wisp Beta 1.5.3</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 13:18:09 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1507</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li><b>Talk to Wisp fixes.</b> When Wisp can’t hear you, it now tells you why (for example, how to turn on Dictation if your Mac’s speech engine is switched off) instead of doing nothing.</li><li>Macs without a microphone no longer crash when you press the mic, and Wisp always listens through the mic you’re using right now.</li></ul>]]></description>
